Done. Committed as `5e08b8f` — all 25 tests pass, `cargo check` clean.

Changes:
- `src/core/rng.rs:20-36` — `Rng` now serializes the seed **and** the full inner `ChaCha8Rng` state (via `rand_chacha`'s `serde` feature: seed/stream/word_pos), instead of only the seed; deserialization restores the exact stream position. `Rng::new(seed)` unchanged for new games.
- `Cargo.toml` — `rand_chacha = { version = "0.10", features = ["serde"] }`.
- Tests: `roundtrip_continues_stream` (rng.rs) and `save_load_rng_stream_continues` (save.rs) verify post-load draws continue the stream and don't replay the run-start prefix.

Note: save files from before this fix (seed-only) no longer parse — `load_autosave` will reject them gracefully, which is inherent to the format change.
