Diff is clean. Committing:
Done. Issue 07 fixed in `src/core/game.rs`:

- `kill_monster` (src/core/game.rs:327) now routes XP through `player.gain_xp(xp)` instead of the raw `player.xp += xp`.
- On level-up it logs "You are now level N!" to the message log and emits the pre-existing `GameEvent::LevelUp` (audio).
- Added two tests: a kill crossing the threshold levels up with max-stat growth, full heal, log entry, and event; a non-leveling kill only adds XP with no side effects.
- All 29 `cargo test` tests pass; committed as `9b9162d`.
